WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.004
Day 1. Find the Starting Point.

2
00:00:02.454 --> 00:00:07.266
Day one is a check, not a lesson. It shows you where your child is, and where to start.

3
00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:12.072
You hold the grown-up page. Your child gets the page with the pictures.

4
00:00:12.522 --> 00:00:13.699
There are four parts.

5
00:00:14.149 --> 00:00:20.751
Part A. Your child counts each group. Watch the finger. Mark a group only if each picture was touched once.

6
00:00:21.201 --> 00:00:25.299
Part B. Point to each number. Mark it if your child says it right.

7
00:00:25.749 --> 00:00:29.386
Part C. Which is more? Mark each pair your child gets right.

8
00:00:29.836 --> 00:00:34.976
Part D. Put together. Counting on fingers is fine. Mark each one that is right.

9
00:00:35.426 --> 00:00:39.175
Do not teach, and do not correct today. Just watch and mark.

10
00:00:39.625 --> 00:00:45.341
Then read the yellow box at the bottom of your page, from the top. Stop at the first line that fits.

11
00:00:45.791 --> 00:00:50.418
That line tells you where to start. It may be day two, day three, or day six.

12
00:00:50.868 --> 00:00:55.495
Write the four numbers on the page, and keep it. You will look at it again on the last day.
